    "answer": {
      "short": "$707\\text{ cm}^{2}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}r&=30\\div2\\\\r&=15\\text{ cm}\\\\A&=\\pi r^{2}\\\\A&=\\pi(15)^{2}\\\\A&=225\\pi\\text{ cm}^{2}\\\\A&\\approx707\\text{ cm}^{2}\\end{align*}$$\nRounded to the nearest whole square centimetre.",
